title: Planting season begins on Linden Avenue
date: 2026-10-14
author: Maya Chen
excerpt: Forty volunteers, thirty-two trees and one very muddy Saturday to open the season.
image: https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1598335624134-5bceb5de202d?w=1600&q=80
imageAlt: Neighbours kneeling to plant a young tree together
---

Our first planting day of the season brought forty volunteers to Linden Avenue, where thirty-two London planes and red maples went into the ground before lunch.

Thank you to everyone who came — and to Twin Oaks for the coffee.
